body:
Hi,

How can I implement a _setter_ array subscript operator overload? A getter works like this but doesn't require references like C does.

Thanks,
Tom

```
struct MyArray {
  float4 A[MAX_SIZE];
  
  float4 operator[](int ix) {
    if (ix >= MAX_SIZE)
      return 0.0;
    return A[ix];
  };
};
